":false,"timestamp":1786911958349},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! I have:\n- Total farmers markets (excluding territories like PR and VI): I need to sum from the farmers_markets table excluding those rows\n- 2025 US population: 341,784,857\n\nNow I need to create a metric that calculates farmers markets per 100,000 residents. I'll create a build script that reads both sources and joins them to create this metric.\n\nLet me first get the total farmers markets by filtering out territories:","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01K7FhsnpebfPTiqUKAYe9wL","name":"xorq_select","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","on":"farmers_markets","compose":"source.filter(~source.state_abbr.isin(['PR', 'VI'])).aggregate(total_markets=source.farmers_markets.sum())","limit":5}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":12,"output":257,"cacheRead":17662,"cacheWrite":279,"totalTokens":18210,"cost":{"input":0.000012,"output":0.0012850000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0017662,"cacheWrite":0.00034875,"total":0.0034119500000000004},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":104},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786911958349,"responseId":"msg_011Ce74APX7CJHWgzmyBKcCQ","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01K7FhsnpebfPTiqUKAYe9wL","toolName":"xorq_select","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"total_markets\"\n7942\n\n(showing up to 5 rows; pass limit or aggregate to count — do not page)"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786911963845},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! So I have:\n- Total farmers markets (excl. territories): 7,942\n- 2025 US population: 341,784,857\n\nNow I need to calculate: (7,942 / 341,784,857) * 100,000 = 2.3237...\n\nLet me create a build script that calculates this metric precisely, then use xorq_select to get the value.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll create a build script that calculates the farmers markets per 100,000 residents metric:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_0165QbhCsvKk21riT9R6tno6","name":"write","arguments":{"path":".xorq/scripts/build_farmers_markets_per_capita.py","content":"import urllib.request as u\n_o = u.build_opener()\n_o.addheaders = [(\"User-Agent\", \"Mozilla/5.0\")]\nu.install_opener(_o)\n\nfrom xorq.vendor.ibis.common.collections import FrozenDict\nimport xorq.api as xo\n\nso = FrozenDict({\"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0\"})\ncon = xo.pandas.connect()\n\nfact = xo.deferred_read_csv(\n    \"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv\",\n    con,\n    table_name=\"farmers_markets\",\n    storage_options=so,\n)\n\nref = xo.deferred_read_csv(\n    \"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/hussainsultan/369600f5179b22792a2b4c9ed37de056/raw/NST-EST2025-ALLDATA.csv\",\n    con,\n    table_name=\"census_population\",\n    storage_options=so,\n)\n\n# Aggregate farmers markets excluding territories\nfact_total = (\n    fact.filter(~fact.state_abbr.isin(['PR', 'VI']))\n    .aggregate(total_markets=fact.farmers_markets.sum())\n    .mutate(k=xo.literal(1))\n)\n\n# Get US population for 2025\npop_total = (\n    ref.filter(ref.NAME == 'United States')\n    .select('POPESTIMATE2025')\n    .mutate(k=xo.literal(1))\n)\n\n# Join and calculate per 100,000\nexpr = (\n    fact_total.join(pop_total, fact_total.k == pop_total.k)\n    .mutate(\n        markets_per_100k=(fact_total.total_markets / pop_total.POPESTIMATE2025) * 100000\n    )\n    .select('total_markets', 'POPESTIMATE2025', 'markets_per_100k')\n)\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":12,"output":711,"cacheRead":17941,"cacheWrite":303,"totalTokens":18967,"cost":{"input":0.000012,"output":0.0035550000000000004,"cacheRead":0.0017941,"cacheWrite":0.00037875,"total":0.00573985},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":100},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786911963845,"responseId":"msg_011Ce74AkkJhjxPzfyitBTb3","ra